"""Contract ABI literals for RaptorChain's cross-chain contracts.

Single source of truth for the ABI JSON strings previously duplicated inline
across RaptorChain.py, blockProducer.py, raptormasternode.py and bscPusher.py.
Strings are byte-verbatim copies of the originals: web3 parses them as JSON so
whitespace is irrelevant to consumers, but it is preserved to keep the
extraction provably faithful.

The same contract name has shipped with DIFFERENT ABIs over time; the naming
is by generation and the variants must NOT be merged:

- ABI_MASTER_NODE             master proxy WITHOUT staking() (RaptorChain node;
                              its stakingContract line is commented out)
- ABI_MASTER_CLIENT           master proxy WITH staking() (blockProducer /
                              raptormasternode clients)
- ABI_CUSTODY_WITHDRAWALS     custody V2, withdrawals-operator model
                              (Withdrawn / changeWithdrawalOperator /
                              receiveApproval) -- RaptorChain node
- ABI_CUSTODY_STAKING_MANAGER custody V1, stakingManager model -- the clients
- ABI_BEACONCHAIN_MIDDLEWARE  new BeaconChainHandler middleware ABI
                              (relayerSet, extractBeaconMessages,
                              CallExecuted/CallDismissed) -- RaptorChain node
                              and bscPusher (pushBeacon)
- ABI_BEACONCHAIN_LEGACY      old BeaconChain ABI (isValidatorAtBlock,
                              stakingContract, enable/disableValidator) --
                              blockProducer / raptormasternode (sendL2Block)
- ABI_STAKING                 old StakeManager ABI (the clients)
- ABI_RELAYER_SET             relayer set ABI (RaptorChain node only)
- ABI_BEP20                   BEP20 token ABI
- ABI_DATAFEED                cross-chain datafeed slot ABI
"""

